  "bullet_points": [
    "Monitoring & Detection Only Designed to track the presence of Tineola bisselliella in wardrobes and textile storage areas. Not intended to prevent or control infestations.",
    "Pheromone Monitoring Only Entopest pads emit a synthetic sex pheromone to attract and monitor male clothes moths (Tineola bisselliella). This tool assists in the early detection of moth activity and helps track changes over time. Not intended for pest control or prevention.",
    "Species-Specific Monitoring The pheromone in these pads is formulated to attract male Common Clothes Moths (Tineola bisselliella) only. Limited attraction may occur with similar species such as the Case-bearing and Pale-backed Clothes Moths, but effectiveness is not guaranteed.",
